-- SteamVR runtime --

CitraVR communicates with the Valve SteamVR OpenXR runtime via the
OpenXR loader. SteamVR itself is NOT distributed with this binary; the
user must install Steam + SteamVR separately. Linkage is dynamic and at
runtime only.
